{
  "id": "query:what-the-employer-may-see",
  "question": "What information is the employer permitted to see once the referral has been approved?",
  "asOf": "2026-09-01",
  "notes": [
    "The referral does not answer this itself. It names the grant that answers it, and the candidate's own policy still binds: the contact route the profile withholds stays withheld no matter what a referral or a grant says. This is the seam between the trust layer and the DisclosureGrant contract, which is designed and deliberately not implemented."
  ],
